TEARDOWN
--------
oracle run_gate ran `docker compose --profile v0 --profile v1 --profile v2 down -v --rmi all`
(PCB_FLAG=teardown); then mandatory `PCB_FLAG=teardown docker compose ... down -v --rmi all` +
`docker image prune -f`. Verified: no python:3.7.3/3.7.7/3.7.8 images and no harness containers
remain. Case dir is recipe-only text (official base images pulled at up-time; harness.py bind-mounted).
